    "RowId": 8917,
    "Text": "After Completing a Mission"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 8918,
    "Text": "Congratulations on completing the mission objectives!\n\nFirst things first: be sure to claim your mission reward. An icon on your map will mark the reward's location.\n\nWith your mission objectives completed, you are free to explore the Diadem for the remainder of the operation time limit. Aetherial gaps will now allow passage into previously inaccessible lairs, and some will even transport you past the Grounding Gale itself.\n<If(Equal(IntegerParameter(1),0))>\nAt this point in the mission, it is also now possible to switch classes to a Disciple of the Land.\n<Else/> </If>\nYou may choose to withdraw from a mission early via the <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Duty Finder</span> or by leaving the mission area from the <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">base camp</span>."
